  "title": "Hot shots: Sun Xinran, 16, thrills Beijing crowd with both power and touch",
  "description": "Sun Xinran, the 16-year-old junior No. 1, went toe-to-toe with Eva Lys in a succession of high-octane baseline battles in the China Open first round. At 2-1, she switched up the power exchange brilliantly on the 22nd stroke with a clean drop shot winner. Three games later, she fired an off backhand bullet straight into the corner on the 23rd stroke. \"Is there anything she can't do?\" marvelled the commentator.",
